      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Tom_Hanks",
      "label": "Tom Hanks",
      "description": "Tom Hanks is a well-known American actor. His image is used in the meme to convey a stern, disapproving expression, which is a common meme format to represent moral judgment or criticism. This requires knowledge of Tom Hanks as a public figure and the cultural use of his image in internet memes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
